            </note>
            <note corresp="#d14-f2" n="2" xml:id="d14-f2-content">
                <p>On March 29, Nixon addressed the nation
                    regarding Vietnam and domestic problems, devoting a portion of his remarks to
                    defending the military and the defense budget. For the full text of Nixon’s address, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Public Papers: Nixon, 1973</hi>,
                    pp. 234–238.</p>
            </note>
